# MATCHLINE | 03: OPTIONAL DESTRUCTIVE demo reset
# DO NOT run this file in Run All for regular API exploration.
# Requires MATCHLINE_RESET_TOKEN in the server process (>=32 characters).
# Put its matching value into http-client.private.env.json as resetToken.
# This endpoint must REFUSE resetting journal-backed sessions (HTTP 409).
# It is disabled by default (HTTP 404).

### Reset current VOLATILE demo generation (destructive)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{resetToken}}

> {%
  client.test("only an authorized volatile session can reset", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200 || response.status === 403 ||
      response.status === 404 || response.status === 409, "Unexpected reset status");
  });
%}

### Inspect resulting session (read only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/status

### Inspect resulting book (read only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/book?depth=10
